        "Use HTTPS (TLS) for all endpoints; ensure HSTS is enabled where feasible.",
        "Authenticate and authorize API endpoints consistently; minimize token lifetimes and scope."
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "Rendering & Output Encoding",
      "points": [
        "For any user-supplied data that could be rendered in HTML, prefer encoding (escaping) over direct insertion.",
        "If you need to render HTML content from users, always sanitize first and render with safe APIs.",
        "Be mindful of cross-context rendering (HTML, attributes, JavaScript, URLs, CSS) and apply the appropriate escaping for each context."
